{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/709673362d5b1adf9af82ad5c8fcb78a.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/709673362d5b1adf9af82ad5c8fcb78a.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/709673362d5b1adf9af82ad5c8fcb78a.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Armory Simulator</i>, immerse yourself in the captivating and unforgiving world of the Wild West, where every bullet counts, and every customer has a story to tell. Your mission? Build, manage, and expand your own armory, catering to the needs of cowboys, bounty hunters, and outlaws seeking the finest equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/fdf640f15ad3f9738f457328e87e8d00.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/fdf640f15ad3f9738f457328e87e8d00.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/fdf640f15ad3f9738f457328e87e8d00.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/23cbe7ff001660e5c4e08d545f91f3b5.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/23cbe7ff001660e5c4e08d545f91f3b5.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/23cbe7ff001660e5c4e08d545f91f3b5.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your armory the way <i>you</i> want. Change the colors of your walls, floors, and even the exterior to create the shop of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/1eff6ec2ce830dff8d20e08745495e24.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/1eff6ec2ce830dff8d20e08745495e24.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/1eff6ec2ce830dff8d20e08745495e24.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/4ed33b5279a3a953b7ec0b85607c2aa7.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/4ed33b5279a3a953b7ec0b85607c2aa7.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/4ed33b5279a3a953b7ec0b85607c2aa7.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business through a unique skill system. Unlock new items to sell, improve your efficiency, and become the ultimate gunsmith of the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/be494d084664e8a5bffab2c62939318f.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/be494d084664e8a5bffab2c62939318f.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/be494d084664e8a5bffab2c62939318f.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/1b8eaa7aa7d1ec19ceb7c9d15299d1cb.poster.avif?t=1774040422\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/1b8eaa7aa7d1ec19ceb7c9d15299d1cb.webm?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/1b8eaa7aa7d1ec19ceb7c9d15299d1cb.mp4?t=1774040422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Wild West, not everything is legal\u2026 Buy rare and forbidden weapons from the underground market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442290/extras/84b3dd86591